{"id":"n58177-1-8","stage":5,"title":"벽돌 · 砖","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58177-1-8-1","ko":"요즘 민준이는 뭘 하고 산대?","zh":"最近敏俊在做什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"산대?","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산대","audio":"/audio/921d419e4c0767214f81.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7eabbfc93ba08527276d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58177-1-8-2","ko":"듣기로는 공사장에서 벽돌 나르는 일을 한다던데?","zh":"我听说他在建筑工地上搬砖。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"듣기로는","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"듣기로는","audio":"/audio/05d28dbd4447ca85e123.mp3"}},{"text":"공사장에서","meaning":"工地","explanation":"공사장：工地；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"공사장","audio":"/audio/a093781e8b57a4bb5f78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19243","senseId":"1","lemma":"공사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공사장에서","audio":"/audio/84e57bcd6f00d5c68c5f.mp3"}},{"text":"벽돌","meaning":"砖，砖头","explanation":"벽돌：砖，砖头","readings":[{"term":"벽돌","audio":"/audio/cb4ff3d5b0d77277141b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58177","senseId":"1","lemma":"벽돌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벽돌","audio":"/audio/cb4ff3d5b0d77277141b.mp3"}},{"text":"나르는","meaning":"搬，搬运","explanation":"나르다：搬，搬运；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나르다","audio":"/audio/330ea1db86ec429a16f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28302","senseId":"1","lemma":"나르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나르는","audio":"/audio/f4ff5091875744897121.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"한다던데?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄴ다던데：转述听到的情况，并留下确认、补充或对照的语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한다던데","audio":"/audio/a7dd65a1bbc3e28058f1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"a093781e8b57a4bb","term":"공사장","zh":"工地","audio":"/audio/a093781e8b57a4bb5f78.mp3","entryId":"19243","definition":"建设施工的地方。","pronunciation":["공사장"]},{"id":"cb4ff3d5b0d77277","term":"벽돌","zh":"砖，砖头","audio":"/audio/cb4ff3d5b0d77277141b.mp3","entryId":"58177","definition":"建造房屋或楼房等时使用的方形石头。","pronunciation":["벽똘"]},{"id":"330ea1db86ec429a","term":"나르다","zh":"搬，搬运","audio":"/audio/330ea1db86ec429a16f7.mp3","entryId":"28302","definition":"把东西移到别处。","pronunciation":["나르다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6563886b84c19f3ad566.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.469,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58177","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.2957,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我听说他在建筑工地上搬砖。","最近敏俊在做什么呢？","最近公司的工作怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近敏俊在做什么呢？","最近公司的工作怎么样？","我听说他在建筑工地上搬砖。"],"answer":2}]